{"hw":"διασκοπέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">διασκοπέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">διασκοπέω</span> (cf. <span class=\"gk\">διασκέπτομαι</span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">διασκέψομαι</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">διεσκεψάμην</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">διέσκεμμαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">836</span> </span>, but <span class=\"gk\">διεσκέφθαι</span> in pass.sense, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">687</span> </span>:— <b class=\"lex-tr\">look at in different ways, examine</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">consider well,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.38</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">557</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἑξῆς δ. τὸν λόγον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">350e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">168e</span> </span>; also <span class=\"gk\">δ. πρὸς ἑαυτόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Chrm.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">160e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">περὶ σφᾶς αὐτούς, περί τινος,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.71</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">61e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. περί τινος εἰ..</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1272a26</span> </span>: c. gen., <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ἑαυτῶν ἀσφαλείας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">58.7</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς τὰ ἔξω διασκοπεῖσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.59</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">259c</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">look round one, keep watching,</b> <span class=\"gk\">μὴ ὁρῶνται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyn.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.3</span> </span>.</div></div>"}